{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/titulo.gif?t=1746614260\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER THE UMBRELLA, ANNIHILATE DEMONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an <strong>Intense and Frenetic</strong> action-platformer roguelike where quick reflexes and creativity are essential to survive against hordes of <strong>Demons</strong>. Step into the paws of a <strong>Cat with a Raincoat</strong>, embarking on this infernal journey using his trusty <strong>Umbrella</strong> to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/gunbrella.gif?t=1746614260\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVOLVE TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face challenging stages filled with brutal enemies and upgrades to transform your playstyle based on your chosen umbrella. Defeat enemies to earn: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demon Hearts</strong>, which can be used to unlock permanent skills and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood Drops</strong>, which can be used to shop at a <strong>Shady Vendor</strong> and a <strong>Blessed Statue</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/boombrella.gif?t=1746614260\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WANT TO TEST YOUR LIMITS?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to survive against endless hordes of enemies to <strong>Beat Your High Scores</strong> and climb to the top of the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/safezone.gif?t=1746614260\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DON'T FORGET!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cats don't like getting wet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to carve your path through the underworld and reclaim your soul?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510060?t=1746614260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510060?t=1746614260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/0907b54408cbcf4a5a039a78fe886331caa8d338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746614260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/0907b54408cbcf4a5a039a78fe886331caa8d338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746614260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3637460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/titulo.gif?t=1746614260\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER THE UMBRELLA, ANNIHILATE DEMONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an <strong>Intense and Frenetic</strong> action-platformer roguelike where quick reflexes and creativity are essential to survive against hordes of <strong>Demons</strong>. Step into the paws of a <strong>Cat with a Raincoat</strong>, embarking on this infernal journey using his trusty <strong>Umbrella</strong> to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/gunbrella.gif?t=1746614260\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVOLVE TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face challenging stages filled with brutal enemies and upgrades to transform your playstyle